{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24316","headline":"清明日登老君阁望洛城赠韩道士 · 白居易","name":"清明日登老君阁望洛城赠韩道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风光烟火清明日，歌哭悲欢城市间。\n何事不随东洛水，谁家又葬北邙山。\n中桥车马长无已，下渡舟航亦不闲。\n冢墓累累人扰扰，辽东怅望鹤飞还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24316.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24316","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}